-- Keep one source of truth per value. State drives effects, never the reverse, and everything downstream is a derived view (ARCH-SUBSTRATE-001).
-- Add a runtime event to the `FlywheelEvent` discriminated union in `src/infra/events.ts` and update every exhaustive consumer in the same change (ARCH-SUBSTRATE-010).
-- Name events with lowercase dot-delimited domain and action segments, such as `agent.run.started` (ARCH-NAMING-007).
-- Producers emit raw events; subscribers filter (ARCH-STRUCTURE-007).
+**One source of truth per value. State drives effects, never the reverse.** A value that lives in one store does not also live as an adapter property, a registry field, and a signal. Everything downstream is a derived view.
+
+`FlywheelEvent` is a discriminated union in `src/infra/events.ts`. Event names use lowercase dot-delimited domain and action segments, such as `agent.run.started`. Producers emit raw events; subscribers filter. Adding a new event means adding to the union and updating all exhaustive consumers.
 
